  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT"},
  {"comment": "A design for tools/ui-scripts/explode-view.mitcad-ui (mitcad#2113): Base:1 (a 40 x 30 x 10 box at the origin), Lid:1 (a 40 x 30 x 5 box on it, at z 10) and Pin:1 (a 10 x 10 x 20 box standing on the lid at (15, 10, 15)); a drawing Drawing1 without views."},
